# Rayern web app — public, build-time configuration.
#
# Copy to .env (or set these in the Vercel project's environment
# variables) before `npm run build`. Vite INLINES every VITE_* value
# at build time, so changing one re-deploys the bundle; it is never
# read at runtime.
#
# A VITE_* value is PUBLIC: it ships inside the JavaScript bundle and
# anyone can read it. Never put a secret, token or key here.

# Base URL of the Rayern API — absolute, no trailing slash, no path.
# Used by the API client, the error reporter and the funnel beacons.
# Default when unset: https://rayern-backend.onrender.com
# Must also be listed in connect-src in vercel.json, or the browser
# blocks every request it is used for.
VITE_API_URL=https://rayern-backend.onrender.com
